@Jeff Pfaller I know you didn't ask for my thoughts on this but just saw it real quick... 
* Could we use a different word other than mask here since we also have email masks? 
* Could this also be a moment where we gently promote VPN in Firefox? It doesn't fully make someone anon in PBM but can add an extra layer

@Alice Cappo  @Ralph  Peskett  @Nicholas Christowitz 

I chatted with Raja on this. He feels that it is more important to have a very differentiated default on private mode than a muted one that feels private in public. 

We want to shy away from what Safari does. 

That said, could you provide us an option that leans into the deep purples we have today? (or anther way to show that it's private browsing). I think we need classic, AI, and private to all feel like they are part of the fx family, but this is too much of a change for us right now. 

